# Pure SaaS: Design Token Validation & Export

Validate `DESIGN.md`, enforce token consistency, and export tokens:

1. Validate `DESIGN.md`: `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs validate DESIGN.md`.
2. Scan source directory: `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs check-tokens DESIGN.md --source src`.
3. Export tokens if requested:
   - CSS: `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs export-tokens DESIGN.md --format css --out styles/tokens.css`
   - Tailwind: `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs export-tokens DESIGN.md --format tailwind --out tailwind.config.tokens.js`
   - JSON: `node scripts/pure-saas.mjs export-tokens DESIGN.md --format json --out tokens.json`
